      "stem": "The sequence $(u_n)$ is defined by $u_0=1$ and $u_{n+1}=4^{n+1}-(n+1)u_n$ for $n=0,1,2,\\ldots$. Also define $\\displaystyle I_n=\\int_0^1x^n e^{4x}\\,dx$.",
